<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In LTX-2: Efficient Joint Audio-Visual Foundation Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Social Impact</span></a></li>
